        revenueText: "Of FY26 revenue of about ₹1,196cr (company figure), **bottles, appliances and cookware were 39%** (₹464cr), **Larah opalware 34%** (₹412cr) and **glassware 25%** (₹296cr). In Q1 FY27 all three grew on volume: opalware 10%, glassware 17% and the rest 4%. The company does not give a revenue split by channel; it sells through about 250 distributors and more than 24,000 shops, online and quick commerce, business buyers and exports. Filed FY26 sales on Screener are ₹1,175cr.",
